sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P0 as Browser
    participant P1 as BFF
    participant P2 as Private gateway
    participant P3 as Microservice 1
    participant P4 as Security Service
    P0->>P1: Cookie and CSRF
    P1->>P1: Validate session
    P1->>P2: Bearer request
    P2->>P4: Operation RBAC
    P4->>P2: Allow / deny
    P2->>P3: Relay bearer
    P3->>P3: Validate JWT
    P3->>P4: Resource ABAC
    P4->>P3: Allow / deny
    P3->>P3: Commit and audit
    P3->>P1: Response via gateway
    P1->>P0: Business JSON
